# Local Wrangler dev secrets. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and
# fill in real values there. Wrangler loads `.dev.vars` automatically.

# Read by TypeSafeAiClassificationService (src/domain/typesafe-ai-classification-service.ts)
# via RegionStatusService. Without it, every region resolves to UNKNOWN —
# missing data never resolves to GREEN.
# TYPESAFE_AI_API_KEY=
